Boil @pasta{60%g} according to package directions.

On your #plate{}, mix @almond butter{1%tablespoon} with @ras-el-hanout mixed spice{1%teaspoon}.

Drain cooked noodles and pour over almond butter, sprinkle with @salt{to taste} and mix well.

Enjoy!